I received your questionnaire thank you for that.&nbsp; Before I come out to see the site I would like to try to gauge interest in the workforce.&nbsp; I have included what we call a pledge sheet.&nbsp; There is no date associated at this time and this is a tool to give both you and the Red Cross an idea of how many people might come out if you were to host a drive.&nbsp; Once you get 40 names let me know and we can look at next steps.<br />
